  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development and Institutionalisation of the Joint Inter-Sectoral Analysis Framework (JIAF) 2020-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project guides the work of the Joint Intersectoral Analysis Group (JIAG) reflecting the adjusted proposal and adjusted Roadmap and related data entry and exploration platform and capacity building proposals, which needed to be revised due to the impact of the COVID-19 pandemic. It also serves to elicit commitments from organisations and donors to pool and mobilise staff and funding as much as possible in order to finalise a methodologically robust and provisionally validated inter-sectoral analysis framework until field testing is completed; start building staff capacities for its application; identify the bases for a future sustainable quality control mechanism; and initiate the integration of the JIAF in internal processes for its field application.</narrative>
  </description>
